// Example: convert the incoming query to uppercase and return it
const symptom = query.toLowerCase();

if (symptom.includes("headache")) {
return `Possible mild causes include stress, dehydration, or lack of sleep.

Home care:
• Drink plenty of water.
• Rest in a quiet room.
• Eat a light meal if you have skipped one.
• Get enough sleep.

Seek medical care immediately if the headache is sudden and severe, follows a head injury, or occurs with confusion, weakness, fever with stiff neck, or vision changes.`;
}

if (symptom.includes("cold")) {
return `For a mild cold:

• Drink warm fluids.
• Rest.
• Gargle with warm salt water if you have a sore throat.
• Stay hydrated.

If symptoms last more than a week, become severe, or you have difficulty breathing, consult a healthcare professional.`;
}

if (symptom.includes("fever")) {
return `If you have a mild fever:

• Drink plenty of fluids.
• Rest.
• Wear light clothing.
• Monitor your temperature.

Seek medical care promptly if the fever is very high, lasts several days, or is accompanied by severe symptoms such as difficulty breathing, confusion, or persistent vomiting.`;
}

return `Please describe your symptoms in more detail.

Example:
• I have a headache.
• I have a sore throat.
• I have a fever.
• I have a cough.`;
